    "text": "Professor Alvarez would like to set up a 30-minute meeting with Diego for next Wednesday, 2026-09-09, at 10:00am Pacific Time. The department said Diego's CSE451 lecture during that hour is cancelled this week, so he's free then even if his calendar still shows the class. Please let Diego know and add the meeting to his calendar at that time.",
